content:
Both `standards_code` values appear in the transmitter eye-diagram note as one requirement; ITU-T G.957 is also stated globally under **Standard**. The output schema assigns one `standards_code` string per mode, so each pool value gets its own mode with a label tied to where it is evidenced.

```json
{
  "modes": [
    {
      "label": "Module ITU-T G.957 compliance",
      "standards_code": "ITU-T G.957"
    },
    {
      "label": "Transmitter eye diagram (G.957 STM-1/OC-3)",
      "standards_code": "STM-1/OC-3"
    }
  ]
}
```
